					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "LUT\n\nThe LUT node takes a LUT and applies it to the input texture or color(s).\n\nLUT is shorthand for Look-Up Table.\nThis is a .CUBE file containing mathematical instructions to replace colors. \nThis process is done pixel by pixel with a very high accuracy.\nLUT's can be seen as color grading presets"
					}
				},
